Hi David,

On 4/10/2012 11:14 AM, David Westergaard wrote:
> Hello,
>
> I've been trying to use limma to identify genes from the following
> data: http://www.ebi.ac.uk/arrayexpress/experiments/E-GEOD-21340 -
