Hi Anja,

The NA in the result from

     criterion(res2, "BIC")

is telling you four clusters cannot be estimated given your data. This 
may have to do with data conditioning, the columns you chose in your 
dataset or the number of values per column. It is hard to say without 
looking at the data. Is your 'mydata' object too large to send?

Have you looked at the results of summary(res1) and summary(res2) for 
further clues?

I'm also cc'ing the package author/maintainer.

Valerie


