> Dear all,I was just wondering what is the importance of phenoData in the affy analysis?.It might be a very silly question to most of you but I was still confused regarding the same.Thanks,Himanshu Sharma.

The phenoData is simply a container for the information about the
samples run on the arrays.  One need not use the phenoData slot, but
