Dear Stephen

as you might have guessed, the reason that the script raises these 
errors is to make you (i.e. users) look at such dodgy GTF records and to 
verify that these are indeed easily fixable formatting mistakes - 
instead of just proceeding with some sort of automatic resolution and 
potentially running into bigger, more obscure errors downstream.

I suppose if we have enough confidence on what the typical sources of 
dodginess are, and how their resolution can be automated, that could be 
added to the script. Contributions are welcome.

